[00:27.36]1. Please judge me, Lord, observe my loyalty;
[00:33.31]Observe my trust in you and my integrity.
[00:43.31]Examine me, and put me to the test;
[00:51.31]My mind and heart refine, that my soul might be blessed.
[01:01.15](Chorus)
[01:07.15]But as for me, Determined I will be
[01:13.15]to walk eternally In my integrity.
[01:26.68]2. I do not sit with wicked men of lies.
[01:32.68]I hate the company of those who truth despise.
[01:41.70]Jehovah, please, don’t take away my life
[01:49.50]With men who take delight in bribery and strife.
[01:54.91](Chorus)
[02:00.32]But as for me, Determined I will be
[02:08.35]to walk eternally In my integrity.
[02:23.03]3. For I have loved the dwelling of your house.
[02:37.71]Your worship, oh, so pure, I daily will espouse.
[02:52.39]And I will march around your altar grand,
[02:59.39]To make thanksgiving heard aloud throughout the land.
[03:06.12](Chorus)
[03:12.85]But as for me, Determined I will be
[03:19.58]to walk eternally In my integrity.